I meant log files were generated for the first 14 traits when I said after preparing for 14 files. Please find the full scripts below for arguments.

files=c(names of sumstats 1 to 19)

ref <- "GenomicSEM/reference.1000G.maf.0.005.txt.gz"
trait.names <- c(corresponding trait names of the 19 sumstats files)
se.logit <- c(TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE)
OLS <- NULL # or use OLS <- c(FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE)
